-- =====================================================================
-- HOREB: Grade 4 Science and Technology skills, prerequisites and misconceptions (owner, 18 Nov 2026)
-- =====================================================================
-- NOT RUN. Run in Supabase Dashboard -> SQL Editor, after 20261110_curriculum.sql (the five curriculum tables); prerequisites may name skills of the grade below, with no foreign key on them. Idempotent: safe to run twice.
-- WHY: Science and Technology Grade 4 skills and misconceptions were in the repository (curriculum/science/g4.json) but no HOREB migration loaded them; the depth pass of 18 Nov 2026 brought every skill to two or more prerequisites and four misconceptions, with a teaching pack. This loads 25 skills (proposed), 51 prerequisites (proposed) and 100 misconceptions (draft)
-- for 9 of 9 sub-strands, for the teacher reviewer. Outcomes are KICD's own words and are not changed.
-- GENERATED by scripts/build-maths-sql-grade.mjs science from curriculum/science/g4.json. Do not edit by hand.
-- The sub-strands and outcomes are inserted first (do nothing if present) so the foreign keys hold.
-- Sub-strands loaded: Plants, Animals, Human Digestive System, Properties of Matter, Management of Solid Waste, Water Conservation, Force and its Effect, Light, Heat.
-- =====================================================================
BEGIN;
DELETE FROM public.curriculum_prerequisites WHERE skill_code LIKE 'SCIE.G4.%' AND requires_kind = 'outcome' AND status = 'proposed' AND (skill_code || '|' || requires_code) <> ALL (ARRAY['SCIE.G4.LIVING.HUMAN_DIGESTIVE_SYSTEM.DIGESTIVE_HEALTH|ENVI.G3.SOCIAL.FOOD_IN_OUR_ENVIRONMENT.d', 'SCIE.G4.MATTER.WATER_CONSERVATION.CONSERVE_IMPORTANCE|ENVI.G3.RESOUR.WATER.d']::text[]);
COMMIT;
